process-foreign-locals.m's worker spawned on the machine's GPU: its foreign
code's locals whose addresses are taken are on its threads' stacks, in the
process's code and in a loop under parallel do in a distribute loop's body.
REQUIRES: amdgpu-gpu

RUN: merkc -O2 -fopenmp -fdo-loops -fprocess-declarations --offload-arch=%offload-arch %libomp-flags %S/process-foreign-locals.m -o %t2
RUN: %gpu-env %t2 gpu | FileCheck %S/process-foreign-locals.m --match-full-lines --strict-whitespace
